        "block_shogun_content": "<div class=\"shogun-2-col-grid\">\n  <div class=\"flex-container\">\n    <div class=\"col-item\">\n      <h3>EdFlex™ Campus (Melbourne)<\/h3>\n      <p><strong>EdFlex™ Campus (Melbourne) is for you if:<\/strong><\/p>\n      <div class=\"lists\">\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <div class=\"icon-holder\">\n            <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0119\/6028\/7313\/files\/tick.svg?v=1590109719\" alt=\"tick\">\n          <\/div>\n          <p><strong>You prefer a structured learning environment<\/strong><\/p>\n          <p>A timetable of practical classes and tutorials over 2.5 days each week at our Sydney campus are supplemented with online theory studies.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <div class=\"icon-holder\">\n            <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0119\/6028\/7313\/files\/tick.svg?v=1590109719\" alt=\"tick\">\n          <\/div>\n          <p><strong>You want an on-campus experience<\/strong><\/p>\n          <p>Located in Artarmon, our College campus is just a train ride from the city centre and is easily accessible by car or bus.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n        <div class=\"item\">\n          <div class=\"icon-holder\">\n            <img src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0119\/6028\/7313\/files\/tick.svg?v=1590109719\" alt=\"tick\">\n          <\/div>\n          <p><strong>You like the buzz of being in the heart of Australia’s leading professional skin-care network<\/strong><\/p>\n          <p>Our College sits within the Ella Baché Head Office: the very heartbeat of the brand and the business. You’ll be sharing the corridors and common areas with our CEO, Sales and Marketing Executives, Education, HR, and Operations teams, and visiting Franchise Owners and beauty media and influencers.<\/p>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"col-item\">\n      <table class=\"shogun-table\">\n        <thead class=\"shogun-table-column-container\">\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-column\">\n              Program\n            <\/td>\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-column\">\n              EdFlex™ Campus (Melbourne)\n            <\/td>\n          <\/tr>\n        <\/thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr class=\"shogun-table-row-container\">\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-row\">\n              <div id=\"s-8e48c0fc-d5a7-4b4e-929d-a12e0e31748e\" class=\"shg-c  \">\n                <div class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"><p><strong>Course length<\/strong><\/p><\/div>\n              <\/div>\n            <\/td>\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-row\">\n              <div id=\"s-a4b82912-63f5-485a-8f27-8e60387ccca3\" class=\"shg-c  \">\n                <div class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">12 months<br><span style=\"font-size: 11px;\">(3 x 15 week terms plus breaks)<\/span><\/p><\/div>\n              <\/div>\n            <\/td>\n          <\/tr>\n          <tr class=\"shogun-table-row-container\">\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-row\">\n              <div id=\"s-3eb3d165-3af2-4449-b57a-48f504346a90\" class=\"shg-c  \">\n                <div class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"><p><strong>Flexible monthly start dates<\/strong><\/p><\/div>\n              <\/div>\n            <\/td>\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-row\">\n              <div id=\"s-6b492ad2-b7e5-46b2-8415-31e30b870be1\" class=\"shg-c  \">\n                <div class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\">February - June - September<\/p><\/div>\n              <\/div>\n            <\/td>\n          <\/tr>\n          <tr class=\"shogun-table-row-container\">\n            <td class=\"shogun-table-row\">\n              <div id=\"s-6cf9db08-a51d-4cf8-a238-6ceb5a789fa9\" class=\"shg-c  \">\n                <div class=\"shg-rich-text shg-theme-text-content\"><p><strong>Dedicated Trainer 