        "block_shogun_content_2": "<div class=\"visit-campus\">      <div class=\"text-center\"><h3>Interested in Visting our campus?<\/h3><\/div>      <div class=\"text-center\"><p><strong>Choose one of our unique campus experiences:<\/strong><\/p><\/div>      <div class=\"blocks\">        <div class=\"flex-container\">          <div class=\"item\">            <a href=\"https:\/\/ella-bache-au.myshopify.com\/pages\/college-make-an-enquiry\">              <p><strong>Campus and class<\/strong><\/p>              <p>Take a campus tour and sit in on one of our classes to learn with our students.<\/p>            <\/a>          <\/div>          <div class=\"item\">            <a href=\"https:\/\/ella-bache-au.myshopify.com\/pages\/college-make-an-enquiry\">              <p><strong>Campus and treatment<\/strong><\/p>              <p>Take a campus tour and receive a complimentary facial or message treatment in our student clinic.<\/p>            <\/a>          <\/div>          <div class=\"item\">            <a href=\"https:\/\/ella-bache-au.myshopify.com\/pages\/college-make-an-enquiry\">              <p><strong>Virtual Campus tour<\/strong><\/p>              <p>If you can't make it on site, don't worry! We can run a virtual campus tour via video conference at a time that suits you.<\/p>            <\/a>          <\/div>        <\/div>      <\/div>    <\/div>"
      }
    },
    "reviews-block": {
      "type": "reviews-block",
      "blocks": {
        "01d1b014-f6d8-471a-b0ba-80ea08b90485": {
          "type": "Reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review": "Just as no two skins are alike, no two students are alike either. Which is why we champion and support the individual to learn in a way that suits them.",
            "author": "Pippa Hallas, Ella Baché CEO"
          }
        },
        "043217b2-be3a-4ed6-abc9-66519d2761da": {
          "type": "Reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review": "I wouldn't want to learn anywhere else. I learnt so much from the Ella Baché Trainers who had a lot of knowledge to share. They really cared about your progress and wanted you to be the best you could be.",
            "author": "LAURA ADAMSON, ELLA BACHÉ COLLEGE ALUMNI"
          }
        },
        "eafbc6b9-cc58-46c1-a26d-b81651d5a601": {
          "type": "Reviews",
          "settings": {
            "review": "Once you step foot in the College you become a part of the Ella Baché brand and family. We work extremely hard behind the scenes for real outcomes, which means jobs and career opportunities for our students.",
            "author": "MEREDITH SCHAERF, ELLA BACHÉ COLLEGE EDUCATION MANAGER"
          }
        }
      },
